# Render with: vhs demo/demo.tape  (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs)
Output demo/demo.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 760
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Type "its-always-dns https://expired.badssl.com"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "echo $?"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "its-always-dns haiku"
Enter
Sleep 3s
